# What scripts/maint.py build puts in the plugin, which Claude Code shows as /lets:<name> and Codex as $lets:<name>.
# One line per entry: name, source folder, who invokes it, and an optional note file prepended to the body (vendored
# text stays verbatim apart from the vocabulary in renames.json).
#   user    a command: you type it; the agent never starts it on its own (plugin/skills/<name>)
#   helper  the agent uses it inside a command; hidden from the / menu (plugin/skills/<name>)
#   ref     not a skill: a reference a command reads by path (plugin/refs/<name>)
#
# The epic route
epic-start      skills/epic-start      user
epic-resolve    skills/epic-resolve    user
epic-overview   skills/epic-overview   user
epic-revise     skills/epic-revise     user
epic-split      skills/epic-split      user
# The change route, and small work
change-start    skills/change-start    user
change-revise   skills/change-revise   user
change-close    skills/change-close    user
patch           skills/patch           user
# Building one change
build           skills/build           user
review          skills/review          user
walkthrough     skills/walkthrough     user
# Around the work
ideas           vendor/addyosmani-agent-skills/skills/idea-refine   user  notes/ideas.md
learn           skills/learn           user
handoff         skills/handoff         user
pickup          skills/pickup          user
retro           skills/retro           user
next            skills/next            user
help            skills/help            user
add             skills/add             user
lens            skills/lens            user
# Lenses: /lets:lens <name> reads one of these (build and change-start also read them by path)
architecture   skills/architecture                                                          ref
api            vendor/addyosmani-agent-skills/skills/api-and-interface-design               ref  notes/addy.md
